# Hire a Crew: "Create a 2/1 black Villain creature token with menace, then creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn."
# On turn 3 Bot1 casts it with a Memnite beside Bot2's Memnite: the new token is a creature Bot1 controls as the pump applies, so
# it is a 3/1 menace Villain; Bot1's Memnite is 2/1 and Bot2's stays 1/1. The pump ends at the turn's cleanup (CR 514.2): on
# turn 4 the token is back to 2/1.

